            <div class="u-mt-32">
                <section data-title="Data availability"><div class="c-article-section" id="data-availability-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="data-availability">Data availability</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="data-availability-content">
              
              <p>The ice core and firn air <sup>14</sup>CH<sub>4</sub> data presented in Fig. <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="figure anchor" href="/articles/s41586-020-1991-8#Fig1">1</a> are provided in Supplementary Information Tables <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="supplementary material anchor" href="/articles/s41586-020-1991-8#MOESM1">2</a>, <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="supplementary material anchor" href="/articles/s41586-020-1991-8#MOESM1">6</a>. Additional measurements not provided in Supplementary Information Tables <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="supplementary material anchor" href="/articles/s41586-020-1991-8#MOESM1">1</a>–<a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="supplementary material anchor" href="/articles/s41586-020-1991-8#MOESM1">8</a> are available via the NSF Arctic Data Center at <a href="https://arcticdata.io/catalog/view/doi%3A10.18739%A2599Z216">https://doi.org/10.18739/A2599Z216</a>.</p>
            </div></div></section><section data-title="Code availability"><div class="c-article-section" id="code-availability-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="code-availability">Code availability</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="code-availability-content">
              
              <p>The code for the firn air inverse model and atmospheric box model (MATLAB) is available from the corresponding author upon request.</p>
